      <activity id="fcdfecac-8eea-501d-b06f-1ae7addf6ad2" activityNameId="c86383b6-c806-53ee-a526-e8e624c10ea5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric storage heater, 5kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric storage heater, 5kW
Inventory for the production of an electric storage heater, 5kW, usage at home, with a life time of 20 years and 2'100 hours of heating within one year. Efficiency of 100% is assumed.;
Synonyms: Elektrospeicherheizung; 
UUID: f0049a79-7a30-32fa-afab-864243056ec1
Infrastructure of the electric storage heater, including all material input. Basic transportations of materials for the production included. No transportation to user, no end of life waste treatment included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at AEG Haustechnik /  STIEBEL ELTRON GmbH &amp; Co. KG (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Materials and energy use based on AEG  Nachtspeicherofen/ electric storage heater published in 2016.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: Data for Germany used with assumptions for Swiss energy supply.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f0049a79-7a30-32fa-afab-864243056ec1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
